aragraph\" >to appear,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >or be supplanted,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unto encounters most unkindly!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thy playtime shouldst be about ONE hour!</p>","developers":["Daniels \u0160losbergs"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916720/0024e1277f00e8eca67be54ec90dc3218703e6cd/header.jpg?t=1760553086","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916720/518755178/3508a39e8fc59783cf7c3b39fabcc23a0bbcac97/1760104533/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760196843","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916720/518755178/3508a39e8fc59783cf7c3b39fabcc23a0bbcac97/1760104533/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760196843","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3916720/518755178/3508a39e8fc59783cf7c3b39fabcc23a0bbcac97/1760104533/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760196843","id":257215690,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215690/movie480.mp4?t=1760196843","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215690/movie_max.mp4?t=1760196843"},"name":"Announcement trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257215690/d7f91d9319970d154b5913875d638b8b4019dff2/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760196843","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215690/movie480.webm?t=1760196843","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257215690/movie_max.webm?t=1760196843"}}],"name":"Scary 8 Bits","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 5 7430U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</st